! out2.md — research, 2026-10-26

Verbatim scratch record `.lares-scratch/research/hands-room/luna/out2.md` (research, file date 2026-10-26); only Markdown transliterated to memetic-wikitext, its words kept as written. Index: [[workshop index|lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/history/workshop/research/hands-room/luna/index]].

